---
import '../../../styles.css';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Seller orders | Vetit Online</title></head><body><div class="page-shell"><SiteHeader sellerMode/><main class="product-showcase seller-orders">
<h1>Seller orders and shipping</h1><p>Order lines and shipments for businesses you actively manage. Customer-wide totals and private addresses are not exposed here.</p><a href="/seller">Seller dashboard</a>
<p id="seller-orders-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading seller orders…</p><div id="seller-orders-content"></div><button id="seller-orders-reload" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Reload orders</button>
<p>Shipping requires a carrier and tracking reference. Returns need an approved policy and persistence backend; no refund or payment is triggered from this workspace.</p>
</main></div><script src="../../lib/seller/orders-page.ts"></script><style>.seller-orders{max-width:1100px;} .seller-orders article{margin:1rem 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;} .seller-orders form{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;} .seller-orders input,.seller-orders select{min-width:0;padding:.75rem;max-width:100%;}</style></body></html>
